{"slug":"metformin","title":"雙胍類(Metformin)","subtitle":"Biguanides","category":"drug","aliases":["Metformin","Glucophage","雙胍類","Biguanide","庫魯化"],"dzTags":["糖尿病"],"system":"endocrine","alsoIn":[],"group":"antidiabetics","reviewed":false,"updated":"2026-09-26","references":[{"title":"American Diabetes Association. Standards of Care in Diabetes(最新年度版)","url":"https://diabetesjournals.org/care"},{"title":"ADA. 9. Pharmacologic Approaches to Glycemic Treatment - Standards of Care in Diabetes—2026","url":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S009"},{"title":"ADA. 11. Chronic Kidney Disease and Risk Management - Standards of Care in Diabetes—2026","url":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S011"},{"title":"ADA. 3. Prevention or Delay of Diabetes and Associated Comorbidities - Standards of Care in Diabetes—2026","url":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S003"},{"title":"ADA. 16. Diabetes Care in the Hospital - Standards of Care in Diabetes—2026","url":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S016"},{"title":"中華民國糖尿病學會《糖尿病臨床照護指引》","url":"https://www.endo-dm.org.tw/"},{"title":"OpenStax. Pharmacology for Nurses, Antidiabetic Drugs(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)","note":"僅作為撰寫參考"}],"intro":{"type":"root","children":[]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第二型糖尿病傳統第一線用藥"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(國考答案);ADA 2026 改為依共病個別化選藥,metformin 仍是常用、便宜的選項,但合併 ASCVD、心衰竭、CKD 者應優先納入 SGLT2i/GLP-1 RA(來源:"},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S009"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ADA Standards of Care 2026 第 9 章"}]},{"type":"text","value":")。主要"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"減少肝臟糖質新生"}]},{"type":"text","value":",降低空腹血糖。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不刺激胰島素分泌 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"單用不會低血糖"}]},{"type":"text","value":";體重中性或略降。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"最常見副作用:"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腸胃不適"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(噁心、腹瀉、食慾減退)→ "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"隨餐或飯後"}]},{"type":"text","value":"服用、由低劑量開始。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"長期使用注意"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"維生素 B₁₂ 缺乏"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(定期檢測);罕見但嚴重的"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"乳酸中毒"}]},{"type":"text","value":" → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"eGFR < 30 禁用、eGFR < 45 不新開始"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、顯影劑檢查前後暫停(來源:"},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S009"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ADA Standards of Care 2026 第 9 章"}]},{"type":"text","value":")。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"mechanism","depth":2,"number":"二、","title":"作用機轉","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"活化肝臟的 AMPK → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"抑制肝臟糖質新生"}]},{"type":"text","value":",減少肝臟釋出葡萄糖(主要作用;見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"glucose-homeostasis#hepatic-glucose"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"肝臟的產糖"}]},{"type":"text","value":")。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"增加肌肉等周邊組織對胰島素的敏感性與葡萄糖利用。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"減少腸道吸收葡萄糖、增加腸道 GLP-1。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不作用在 β 細胞"}]},{"type":"text","value":",不增加胰島素分泌。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"agents","depth":2,"number":"三、","title":"代表藥物","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Metformin(常見商品名 Glucophage);另有緩釋劑型(每日一次,腸胃副作用較少)與多種複方(合併 DPP-4i、SGLT2i 等)。"}]}]}},{"id":"indications","depth":2,"number":"四、","title":"適應症","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第二型糖尿病"},{"type":"text","value":":傳統上是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"無禁忌症時的第一線"}]},{"type":"text","value":",並持續作為合併治療的基礎(國考答案)。ADA 2026 已改寫為「以病人為中心、依共病選藥」"},{"type":"text","value":":沒有"},{"type":"text","value":" ASCVD/HF/CKD 等特殊考量、只需降血糖時,metformin 是常用且歷來的第一線;合併 ASCVD、心衰竭或 CKD 者,不論是否使用 metformin、不論 HbA1c,都應包含具實證的 SGLT2i 和/或 GLP-1 RA(來源:"},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S009"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ADA Standards of Care 2026 第 9 章"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 建議 9.5、9.7、9.8、9.10)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"糖尿病前期高危險者的預防"},{"type":"text","value":":特別是"},{"type":"text","value":" 25–59 歲且 BMI ≥ 35、空腹血糖 ≥ 110 mg/dL 或 HbA1c ≥ 6.0%,以及曾有妊娠糖尿病者(來源:"},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S003"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ADA Standards of Care 2026 第 3 章"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 建議 3.7)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"多囊性卵巢症候群(改善胰島素阻抗,屬仿單外使用)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"pharmacokinetics","depth":2,"number":"五、","title":"藥動重點","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"不經肝臟代謝,"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"以原型由腎臟排出"}]},{"type":"text","value":" → 腎功能下降時藥物蓄積,乳酸中毒風險上升。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"依 eGFR 調整:"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"< 30 禁用/停用"}]},{"type":"text","value":";"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"< 45 不新開始"}]},{"type":"text","value":",已使用者 eGFR 降到 < 45 時減量並重新評估利弊(來源:"},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S009"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ADA Standards of Care 2026 第 9 章"}]},{"type":"text","value":";"},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://doi.org/10.2337/dc26-S011"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ADA Standards of Care 2026 第 11 章"}]},{"type":"text","value":" 引述 FDA 2016 指引)。eGFR 30–45 者腎功能波動時易掉到 ≤ 30,乳酸中毒風險升高(同上來源)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"adverse-effects","depth":2,"number":"六、","title":"副作用與禁忌","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"table","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"